// A project template (python dng.py new --template sp-2d): the project is made of the layers, in order, each one's files
// replacing those of the layers before it, then of this dir's own files. This file is not copied.
description:t="Single-player 2D game: the game is its own server; a world in the XY plane through an orthographic camera"
multiplayer:b=no
layer:t="_common"
layer:t="_singleplayer"
layer:t="_2d"
